{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a singleprofile multimodal setup using the high-performing imagenet_vit_l image encoder and pca_n2000 RNA encoding, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5353 and F1 of 0.5187. The result suggests the imagenet_vit_l encoder may contribute to performance compared to prior singleprofile setups with resnet50, but its impact remains uncertain without direct comparison to other encoders. The role of multiprofile settings in driving performance cannot be isolated here, as multiprofile configurations with the same encoder achieved higher accuracy in prior experiments."
}

